Pakedge SX-8P device support for OpenWrt v25.12.6 (target realtek/rtl838x, kernel 6.12).
Apply in an OpenWrt checkout: git apply <this file>

diff --git a/target/linux/realtek/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network b/target/linux/realtek/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network
